<section class="caal-information-panel caal-feedback-panel" lang="en" aria-labelledby="caal-feedback-title">
  <h2 id="caal-feedback-title">Help improve the vocabularies</h2>
  <p>Suggest a correction, translation, definition or link to another vocabulary. You can also ask a question about how to use the Vocabulary Explorer.</p>
  <p>If your feedback is about a term, include its link or concept ID, the language and the change you propose. Add a source if you have one.</p>
  <a class="caal-information-action" href="https://data.uclcaal.org/#feedback">Open the CAAL feedback form</a>
  <p class="caal-information-note">The form opens in the CAAL Public Viewer. Choose General and include the term link in your message.</p>
</section>
